# ── Keep the Docker image small enough for Render's free plan (512 MB RAM) ──
# These files are on GitHub (via Git LFS) for local use, but loading them on a
# 512 MB server crashes it. Without them the app runs in "lite" mode: every
# notebook tab, the User Portal and Live Prediction work; Workbench lookups
# and the Overview transaction search say the data isn't available.
# On a paid instance with 2–4 GB RAM, delete the "Large data" block below
# to deploy the full app.

.git
.gitattributes
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints
notebooks/
docs/
scripts/

# Large data
data/cleaned_transactions.csv
data/featured/
data/preprocessed/
data/precomputed/*.parquet
data/precomputed/*.npz
data/precomputed/new_txn_index.json
results/final_risk_scores.csv
results/final_ensemble_risk_scores.csv
results/master_risk_scores.csv
results/graph_features.csv
results/graph_node_analysis.csv
results/xgb_predictions.csv
models/random_forest.pkl
